  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Design-time enums: define enums in the designer and use them from scripts and fields, with rename tracking and equivalence to same-named .NET enums.\n      - Field-level permissions: per-field read/write rules.\n      - Focus control (FocusControlMode): configurable focus order, wrap-around and next-field targeting.\n      - Database: PostgreSQL interval support; Oracle Id and IntervalYearToMonth field conversion; ExecuteSql reimplemented over IDbAccessor (non-breaking - the legacy path is used when IDbAccessor is not provided).\n      - Public API to abstract advanced value/text conversion.\n      - SQL debug logging.\n      - Script engine performance tuning.\n      - Grid OnKeyDown deprecated; deprecated fields can be hidden; the \"exclude from change detection\" and \"input validation\" settings can be hidden.\n      - Removed the unused public ModuleSubmitLog / ModuleSubmitLogType types.\n      - Reduced the WebAssembly download size: AI documentation resources are no longer embedded in the runtime assembly (they now ship with the Designer package).\n      - Fixes: double-clicking an unreadable module no longer throws; script default-value handling fixed.",
